    "summary": "**[Lone Operative](vsdata:core-ability/lone-operative)**. A model outside an attached unit is unseen by attackers more than 12 inches away. Their weapons cannot target it at that distance, even with **[[INDIRECT FIRE]](vsdata:weapon-ability/indirect-fire)**. An explicit distance on this ability replaces 12 inches for visibility and targeting.",
